invariant: INV-40
file: test/qemu-m3.sh
catches: test/script-builds.sh
reason: test/qemu-m3.sh skips on CI where a tool is missing, as it did while
  CI's check job had the linker under a name the script did not look for.
  The script's run is the one check of its Cortex-M3 build, which stopped
  compiling when ct_wipe.c gained <string.h>, and no check failed.
  test/script-builds.sh runs the script with CI set and no linker, and
  requires it to fail.

--- old
    if [ -n "${CI:-}" ]; then
--- new
    if false; then
